{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38847","headline":"题庐岳刘处士草堂 · 杜荀鹤","name":"题庐岳刘处士草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙境闲寻采药翁，草堂留话一宵同。\n若看山下云深处，直是人间路不通。\n泉领藕花来洞口，月将松影过溪东。\n求名心在闲难遂，明日马蹄尘土中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}